<title>INDONESIA: Sampoerna says 1996 net at 396.54 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Sampoerna says 1996 net at 396.54 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>				  (in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Sales			 2,366.31    vs    1,687.79</p>
<p>    Net profit			  396.54    vs     352.21</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    441	vs	391</p>
<p>    Gross profit			879.38    vs	732.22</p>
<p>    Income from operations	  636.32    vs	532.44</p>
<p>    Other income			(88.88)   vs	(26.82)</p>
<p>    Minority interest		  (1.36)   vs	  1.52</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		 891.52    vs	618.74</p>
<p>Note: The results were audited. PT Hanjaya Mandala Sampoerna is one of Indonesia's largest tobacco companies.</p>
</text>
